<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-Boral half year net profit falls.</title>
<headline>RTRS-Boral half year net profit falls.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1996-03-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Half year to Dec 31</p>
<p>		 (million A$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Operating profit		   155.77 vs 178.53</p>
<p>    Net				     93.16 vs 169.71</p>
<p>Dividend (cents) 7.5 vs 10.5</p>
<p>NOTE: Boral Ltd is a building products manufacturer.  </p>
<p>    Sales (billion)			2.42 vs 2.42</p>
<p>    Other income			 235.21 vs 186.51</p>
<p>    Shr (cents)			     8.2 vs 15.3</p>
<p>    Abnormal items		 gain 22.66 vs gain 31.23</p>
<p>Dividend is 100 pct franked</p>
<p>Pay date Apr 30</p>
<p>Reg date Apr 9</p>
<p>    Tax				     82.65 vs 36.60</p>
<p>    Interest				69.41 vs 69.93</p>
<p>    Depreciation			 141.15 vs 138.61</p>
<p>    Minorities			     2.62 vs 3.45</p>
<p>NOTE: Segment results (operating profit)</p>
<p>    Building products		   68.92 vs 93.90</p>
<p>    Construction materials	    62.55 vs 61.33</p>
<p>    Energy				  79.69 vs 82.65</p>
<p>Services and engineering  profit 0.66 vs loss 1.62</p>
<p>    Other			     loss 1.55 vs profit 0.66</p>
<p>-- Sydney newsroom 61-2 9373-1800</p>
